  (text "VIN bisa sampai 40 V bila input 24 V AC. Semua komponen di rail VIN minimal 60 V. U1 wajib versi HV (LM2596HVS), bukan LM2596S biasa."
    (at 11.66 82.32 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 25412417-912c-4f3e-8914-014951021e1d)
  )
  (text "B. USB C   unggah firmware dan debug"
    (at 298.68 16.9 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 2.2 2.2) (thickness 0.44) bold)
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid 361b2c3f-743a-4879-9497-2513b6b22172)
  )
  (text "USB hanya data dan daya meja (lewat D pada blok A)."
    (at 298.68 82.32 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 8b19ede7-a304-48a9-ae46-d21fb5f45338)
  )
  (text "C. ANTARMUKA DI UNIT   LED status, tombol, buzzer"
    (at 423.14 16.9 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 2.2 2.2) (thickness 0.44) bold)
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid f859d8f6-c397-4849-bb29-a45ddaa073cb)
  )
  (text "D. MCU ESP32 S3"
    (at 11.66 93.1 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 2.2 2.2) (thickness 0.44) bold)
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid dc270497-6c23-41b2-bba6-8ea9feff4548)
  )
  (text "IO0 = BOOT, EN = RESET. USB bawaan di IO19 / IO20, tidak perlu chip USB ke UART."
    (at 11.66 173.76 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid c4ac7e9b-6f39-42a7-9dc0-83f6aecb93cf)
  )
  (text "E. BUS I2C   ADC, RTC, sensor aliran"
    (at 199.62 93.1 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 2.2 2.2) (thickness 0.44) bold)
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid ffb59256-8e25-478f-8193-af7414a4405c)
  )
  (text "Urutan pin sama dengan sensor: 1 IRQn (tidak dipakai), 2 SDA,\n3 VDD 3,3 V, 4 GND, 5 SCL, 6 NC. Konektor di sensor: Molex PicoBlade 6 pin."
    (at 205.74 189.23 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid e3992eae-623b-48cb-9e3e-a8af229dd8e9)
  )
  (text "F. FRONT END TEKANAN   0,5 sampai 4,5 V ke ADC"
    (at 412.98 93.1 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 2.2 2.2) (thickness 0.44) bold)
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid de1c16a6-7f98-4523-a1ae-567c938e89b2)
  )
  (text "Pin konektor: 1 = +5V, 2 = GND, 3 = sinyal. AIN3 memantau rail 5 V (ratiometrik)."
    (at 412.98 211.86 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 4b31ea83-c3d6-4b99-bbea-a8172776ead6)
  )
  (text "G. DRIVER KATUP   hanya untuk rig bench test (solenoid 24 V DC)"
    (at 11.66 230.26 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 2.2 2.2) (thickness 0.44) bold)
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid 5a3953da-8078-469d-be89-bbfa7b0c4b72)
  )
  (text "Di produk jadi blok ini tidak dipasang: modul meminta flush ke kontroler unit dan hanya membaca status lewat blok H."
    (at 11.66 288.06 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 2cff5cba-70d9-4038-9bb6-6efa97948c13)
  )
  (text "H. STATUS SOLENOID UNIT   masukan 24 V AC/DC terisolasi optocoupler"
    (at 285.98 230.26 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 2.2 2.2) (thickness 0.44) bold)
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid 5d8858db-f4ad-46ee-9029-ce76f8b70e94)
  )
  (text "MEKANIK"
    (at 514.58 230.26 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 2.2 2.2) (thickness 0.44) bold)
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid 229d3f89-a85f-42b4-921e-f5165e488f9f)
  )
  (text "CATATAN DESAIN"
    (at 11.66 329.32 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 2.2 2.2) (thickness 0.44) bold)
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid 1459b9b2-4818-48e1-b902-ad350ed6bbfb)
  )
  (text "1. Input 24 V AC atau DC dari PSU internal dental unit. Jembatan dioda D1 membuat polaritas bebas. Modul tetap tegangan rendah (SELV)."
    (at 15.24 342.9 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid e78bc1b9-24ce-42cc-9bb0-2a51eb665812)
  )
  (text "2. GND papan = kutub minus D1, tidak sama dengan 0 V dental unit. Untuk unggah firmware di meja, pakai USB saja dan lepas 24 V,"
    (at 15.24 348.234 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 7fcf0803-4c38-4eb0-836a-12e11959900a)
  )
  (text "    atau pakai laptop dengan baterai. Jangan menyambung GND papan ke rangka unit."
    (at 15.24 353.568 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 2abb4c00-d079-4fed-864a-28470fee8d47)
  )
  (text "3. +5V (keluaran buck) hanya untuk transduser tekanan. VSYS = +5V atau VBUS lewat dioda, untuk LDO, LED WS2812 dan buzzer."
    (at 15.24 358.902 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid b46c274e-0f6a-41b6-8cfc-7e158d70f379)
  )
  (text "4. Transduser tekanan: 0 sampai 1 MPa, keluaran 0,5 sampai 4,5 V. Pembagi 10k / 20k menurunkan ke 0,33 sampai 3,0 V. ADS1115 pakai PGA 4,096 V."
    (at 15.24 364.236 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 25c8c0d0-3535-44c7-b276-7390c7ccbd44)
  )
  (text "5. Sensor aliran SLF3S-4000B: suplai 3,2 sampai 3,8 V, tekanan maksimum 3 bar, alamat I2C 0x08. Pasang setelah regulator air."
    (at 15.24 369.57 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 4de33c51-ad0b-43a0-977e-dec31513be13)
  )
  (text "6. Alamat I2C: ADS1115 0x48, DS3231 0x68, SLF3S 0x08."
    (at 15.24 374.904 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 0104c825-45d2-441d-b0d3-d3f14c43bb69)
  )
  (text "7. Q katup pakai AO3422 (55 V), bukan AO3400 (30 V), karena VIN bisa melebihi 30 V."
    (at 15.24 380.238 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid acaa95f2-e812-46d3-b372-512158e62d3c)
  )
  (text "8. Blok H: C 1 uF di keluaran opto meratakan pulsa 50 Hz bila solenoid unit digerakkan 24 V AC."
    (at 15.24 385.572 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 62f4bfd8-bce8-48c6-8a39-e3c8de034c53)
  )
